    "title": "使用 Oracle JDBC 驱动或连接串",
    "severity": "high",
    "files": ["*.java", "*.xml", "*.properties", "*.yml", "*.yaml", "*.gradle", "*.kts"],
    "patterns": ["oracle\\.jdbc", "jdbc:oracle:", "com\\.oracle\\.database\\.jdbc", "<artifactId>ojdbc"],
    "requires": ["target.db not in oracle"],
    "advice": "替换为目标库驱动与连接串（达梦 dm.jdbc.driver.DmDriver / jdbc:dm://host:5236；金仓 com.kingbase8.Driver / jdbc:kingbase8://host:54321/db；openGauss org.opengauss.Driver / jdbc:opengauss://host:5432/db；OceanBase com.oceanbase.jdbc.Driver）。驱动 jar 通常不在 Maven 中央库，需要放进企业私服并固定版本。",
    "kb": "db-dialects.md#驱动与连接串",
    "effort": "S"
  },
