    "title": "Oracle 专有语法（ROWNUM / CONNECT BY / (+) 外连接 / DUAL / 序列 NEXTVAL）",
    "severity": "high",
    "files": ["*.xml", "*.sql", "*.java", "*.cs"],
    "patterns": ["\\bROWNUM\\b", "\\bCONNECT\\s+BY\\b", "\\bSTART\\s+WITH\\b", "\\(\\+\\)", "\\bFROM\\s+DUAL\\b", "\\.\\s*NEXTVAL\\b", "\\bMERGE\\s+INTO\\b"],
    "flags": "i",
    "requires": ["source.db in oracle,unknown", "target.db not in oracle"],
    "severity_by": {"target.db": {"dm8": "low", "kingbase": "low", "gaussdb": "medium", "opengauss": "medium", "oceanbase": "medium"}},
    "advice": "达梦/金仓在 Oracle 兼容模式下大多可直接运行（需确认实例兼容参数），openGauss/GaussDB 需 A 兼容模式并逐条验证；不兼容时改写为 LIMIT/OFFSET、递归 CTE、标准 LEFT JOIN、自增/序列函数。",
    "kb": "db-dialects.md#oracle-→-国产库",
    "effort": "M"
  },
  {
