    "kb": "db-dialects.md#存储过程",
    "effort": "L"
  },
  {
    "id": "DB-MY-001",
    "category": "database",
    "title": "MySQL 专有语法（反引号 / LIMIT a,b / ON DUPLICATE KEY / REPLACE INTO / IFNULL / GROUP_CONCAT / AUTO_INCREMENT）",
    "severity": "medium",
    "files": ["*.xml", "*.sql", "*.java", "*.cs"],
    "patterns": ["`\\w+`", "\\bLIMIT\\s+(\\d+|#\\{\\w+\\}|\\$\\{\\w+\\}|\\?)\\s*,", "\\bON\\s+DUPLICATE\\s+KEY\\b", "\\bREPLACE\\s+INTO\\b", "\\bIFNULL\\s*\\(", "\\bGROUP_CONCAT\\s*\\(", "\\bAUTO_INCREMENT\\b", "\\bDATE_FORMAT\\s*\\(", "\\bSTR_TO_DATE\\s*\\(", "\\bINSERT\\s+IGNORE\\b"],
    "flags": "i",
    "requires": ["source.db in mysql,unknown", "target.db not in mysql"],
    "severity_by": {"target.db": {"oceanbase": "info", "kingbase": "low", "dm8": "medium", "gaussdb": "low"}},
    "advice": "目标库开启 MySQL 兼容（金仓 MySQL 模式、GaussDB B 兼容、OceanBase MySQL 租户、达梦 COMPATIBLE_MODE=4）可降低改写量；仍需改的：反引号改双引号或去掉、ON DUPLICATE KEY 改 MERGE、LIMIT a,b 改 LIMIT b OFFSET a。",
    "kb": "db-dialects.md#mysql-→-国产库",
    "effort": "M"
  },
  {
